# Invariants 5 and 6 through Plan 2's real ACL (fix wave I6, C2 and C3): the instance runs
# api.ResolverACL and api.StructureChannels, and the channel is a text channel of a community. A
# group bound to that community but to no channel of it is refused at registration.
# carol holds an outstanding instance Add when she is kicked from the community, and bob is kicked
# while he is offline, both through DELETE /v1/communities/{cid}/members/{user}. The kick voids
# carol's Add (she is no longer eligible) and proposes the Remove of bob's leaf, which freezes the
# group: alice's send is refused 425 until she commits. Her commit is ACCEPTED - with carol's Add
# still outstanding it could not be, because invariant 4 refuses a commit that adds an ineligible
# user, and the group would stay frozen. dave then reads alice's next message; bob, back online, is
# no longer a current leaf, and his attempt to rejoin by external commit is refused by the ACL:
# the group's GroupInfo is 404 to a user it no longer admits.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
client dave
channel c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4 visibility=private mode=e2ee community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3 members=alice
group chat kind=text target=c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4 community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3 creator=alice
channel c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4c4 community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3 members=bob,carol,dave
expect_reject E_BINDING_INVALID group rogue kind=text target=c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9c9 community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3 creator=carol
join bob chat via=welcome
join dave chat via=welcome
sync bob
admit chat carol
go_offline bob
kick alice carol community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3
kick alice bob community=c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3c3
expect_425 send alice chat before the kick is committed
commit alice
send alice chat after the kick
expect_decrypts dave chat after the kick
go_online bob
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT send bob chat am I still here
expect_reject E_NOT_FOUND resync bob chat
